 (\\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{4(1-{x}^{2})}+4x)\\text{d}x$  for $|x|<1.$" :question/worked-solution "The derivative of the inverse hyperbolic tangent function is given by\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{artanh}⁡x)=\\frac{1}{1-{x}^{2}}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int (\\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{4(1-{x}^{2})}+4x)\\text{d}x & =\\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{4}\\int \\frac{1}{1-{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x+4\\int x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{4}\\operatorname{artanh}⁡x+2{x}^{2}+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186360622 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186166760 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "607b412e-f875-584f-87b3-627801f20b5c" :knowledge-point/title "Integrating Using Artanh"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "a80823ff-a65a-5f89-b8f8-8e21fe5f3ebc" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{e}^{x}-6\\operatorname{artanh}⁡\\frac{x}{5}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186359202} {:answer/id #uuid "adb2b099-96e6-528b-b7da-465f8969a86e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{e}^{x}-\\frac{6}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡5}\\operatorname{artanh}⁡x+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186359257} {:answer/id #uuid "bb30d9ca-b3fd-5536-8ee8-67168eef2aab" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{e}^{x}-\\frac{6}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡5}\\operatorname{arcoth}⁡x+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186359377} {:answer/id #uuid "caa1c6d0-c893-5867-ac87-4b2880452912" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{e}^{x}-\\frac{6}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡5}\\operatorname{arsinh}⁡x+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186359529} {:answer/id #uuid "fe968d65-4ec4-54a1-8bb1-3cafdd5acfdf" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{e}^{x}-5\\operatorname{artanh}⁡5x+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186359992}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a